    <string name="paywall_description">We have put in a lot of work into APKMirror Installer over the years and continue to invest in the updates to make sure it remains the best option for installing app bundles and APKs on Android devices.

Unfortunately, per Google's rules, Android TV apps are not allowed to use banner advertising for monetization.

Therefore, to support ongoing development of APKMirror Installer on Android TV, we offer a subscription that includes:
   - Ad-free usage of APKMirror Installer on all of your Android devices
   - Unlimited Android TV support

We have granted 1 free installation to test the functionality of APKMirror Installer.

The APKMirror team thanks you for your continued support and understanding.</string>
