    <string name="start_help_description">APKMirror Installer (beta) helps you manage and install the new generation of Android install files created by Google called Android App Bundles (packaged as .apkm, .xapk, .apks files).

A bundle is an all-in-one package that consists of a base APK and a number of configuration APKs. Unfortunately, Android doesn't natively support on-device sideloading of such bundles, and an app like APKMirror Installer (beta) is required to install them.</string>
